Falsifies `address_space_layout::verification::runtime_window_accepts_every_page_of_its_band`.

The defect: `runtime_window` asks `window` for two pages, so the last page of `RUNTIME_WINDOWS` is refused.

Expected to fail: Kani reports "a window must lie wholly inside its band" reachable at the last page of the band.

diff --git a/crates/address_space_layout/src/lib.rs b/crates/address_space_layout/src/lib.rs
index cb71c3977..4572c9610 100644
--- a/crates/address_space_layout/src/lib.rs
+++ b/crates/address_space_layout/src/lib.rs
@@ -255,7 +255,7 @@ pub const fn pair_page(virtual_address: u64) -> u64 {
 /// **A runtime window's address, checked against the map at compile time.** As [`pair_page`], for
 /// [`RUNTIME_WINDOWS`].
 pub const fn runtime_window(virtual_address: u64) -> u64 {
-    window(RUNTIME_WINDOWS, virtual_address, PAGE)
+    window(RUNTIME_WINDOWS, virtual_address, 2 * PAGE)
 }
 
